7. What will be the output of the following code?

```python
x = 10
y = 8
if x > 5:
    if y < 10:
        print('Both conditions met')
    else:
        print('Second condition not met')
else:
    print('First condition not met')
```

8. What will be the output of the following nested if-statement?

```python
x = 5
y = 10
z = 15
if x < y:
    if y < z:
        if x + y > z:
            print('Nested condition met')
        else:
            print('Inner condition not met')
    else:
        print('Middle condition not met')
else:
    print('Outer condition not met')
```
